&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering Medical Affairs programmes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing medical affais deliverables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent project and financial management skills, with experience managing budgets and forecasting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding organisational skills and the ability to manage multiple priorities simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and stakeholder management skills with confidence working directly with global pharmaceutical clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring and developing junior team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, collaborative approach with a passion for delivering exceptional client service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to work on a high-profile account within an exciting and rapidly evolving therapy area, partnering with clients who value collaboration and strategic thinking.&lt;/p&gt;
